      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fbf9a4b409691a4a787a70f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是多伯前辈\r\n偶尔也会因为吵闹过头了而生气……\r\n但前辈就算生气也没那么可怕Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "196e0c512d0d2bd863f3fd3c39651c3d40398724c4521cd731c9c0d8bbe4f88e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "400029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54c1350fde8c51b74d63a8ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "神鹰猛击波！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71c0d32fa0179c423aa4b5881410c898e23582f6e16b91fbc433f12f07b055a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f856e4954750d618992f9414",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼！神鹰的真本事，敬请欣赏！嚯……兀鹰劈！EI十字斩！último奥义！神鹰猛击波！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f151410b224c8f36950b57fc97bf8108af1466bfb3854a17193784b38e33b8d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af54977107df6ff864bc95bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会让你见识到最强的舞台！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7742c89b338d512e99212c7ebbcb9df56a17b690b163bcb4ddca5cce560712aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a217e38e8bc285b75490f6c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论在赛道上还是舞台上，都是我一枝独秀Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "869e5feb4625289782e81664d294a08766480851c76fa292725d19bc09a633c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:989ade6173e96ed314b1e146",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起以世界最强为目标吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a811d0a52a1c8e1f85b49f90153e5e66a19ad73893fa51c99a3cc097ea9dc1f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4670cce4482e99519564886",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员认真的气势！\r\n那些话，那些激情！\r\n都让神鹰超・感・动……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81e5dbddcabcd5e9e2428ca7e865feccbfa91a3b2e0fe04fdf381cc8c8f7c174",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
