    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84c25b28a85703bbda75217b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1c90d8bd1341fc0be8083f030b20b9def055e10f69f5a0bec3878f128336e06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f70865d0a315ae11cbaa811",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正是，“怪鸟”神鹰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a24d2200ac13c2b50ec85acb64d0c981bf1e02896ac138cec001dd78d44f3e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "800000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:946ccd5fc7a2324017b22d0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "世界最强又最快的神鹰！\r\n来当你的对手Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85b4159e88cfbfc9323487d8f9243666c8780c682fda1fe3c166fc9db2019084",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25d006235b1160aa5f0051ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还没还没！\r\n比赛开始的钟才刚响起Dea——th！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "435fafbe3dca2ca768c07074e57fd8c1acad83621b025ea20ca1c7cb4e7ffb78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36c800b9e101e8e62c50918c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "清早，上学，神鹰状态绝佳！\r\nBuenos días！嗯嗯～\r\n今天早上也吹着很舒服的风呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39e8a2e7e5eb357444af5c18de192745b08af8bc36f607833cbbfda62edcaed2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6c17e3ef4b8b49eaa1cbd96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那就来对着炙热燃烧的太阳\r\n吼出今天的第一声招呼吧！\r\n早安De——ath！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6612e706f3dcf4f096bbb6c8399721a60d8a533d87416f950fc11c6e32a35774",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15bd0fc527bc06ec0fa6e657",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你已经吃过午餐了吗？\r\n还没的话，就请你吃神鹰特制的\r\n火辣辣墨西哥卷饼吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e860f7ae14d6270ce453dbaa7d1ef1482e3de6595cb9175fa6788eb648179a13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05e892ef908e94711083ef28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Buenas tardes！\r\n世界最强的神鹰\r\n无论是什么训练都愿意接受挑战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "780a1dc83905e422324c16e37a45805ed85cd4c2322717e11ed8cc12999fc88e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c5fcf7f8b3d4308f6ab8247",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太阳落下后面还会再升起！\r\n太阳一定也为了明天能够再・入・场，\r\n趁晚上的时候储备力量Death……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5fd16550f30ba2026253460205f063d2026d516a32b63f1d4dfc4753744429d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db3317e2803ecd86f9d71512",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耶？明天课堂上要交的作业有\r\nuno，dos，tres……\r\n……小草啊～！！你在哪里啊～～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f88fe3cb4f3b1d3ae2ed6a8905a6b92cc47ef3ea809be65d859496f90669ca0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51293b019e8df3bab7e14405",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到春天就会联想到仙人掌花！\r\n……所以我就把它放在小草的\r\n花瓶旁边！感觉很风雅吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58ed10f02881992d054e6c1ce1180eadbcab6324db8d8b2edc3de6de638e9491",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e320ce0378b7e2ae10d43f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比热气还要热，比热风还要快速！\r\n神鹰强健的双脚\r\n将飞向夏天遥远的天空Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f3812b44795b8c6e49c6b89edf4956c185a077d80ce7607ab15747c7cb76855",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d802c22f4229caaf80ee4e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近白天的时间越来越短了。\r\n但——是！就算是在黑暗之中，\r\n兀鹰也会继续翱翔……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a64cd3ceeb6b9fa3346f9ce9a1313f5635b16d117e54714030c4d818cf674fce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebc3dec714cdf233e2381d03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……日本的暖桌很危險Death。\r\n进去之后面就出不来了，\r\n就像是跟流沙土狱在搏斗一样……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e3c2d37006abf898ece86e397528fffe74461f9e815f07d960a613687e664d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:244994224694d1e59a7d9b5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cómo estás！\r\n一起去参加晨间演武吗？\r\n会变得充满活力哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88bb905ae0d16bd3038fa004b883bf37120348e1c7df4a43d3f6dd58f58e3ffe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:300e9016f578b781f25c4b24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔～！舒畅！痛快！状态绝佳！\r\n多亏了小草的按摩\r\n从早上开始就很清爽Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01f4b2aba5e3d413aa6c84609639409b3ef26081f466e4717d4473dddb7db84a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f03d9eaf4fa1cc6cbe3e9aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午休时间做些什么呢。\r\n无论是拍洋画还是舞蹈，\r\n我都接受挑战Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f473d40f0edf47fbb92c7de58301f43014a662de043c2b3041ea4a5756a2f99b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c073731a6fac0fc8aa2bd3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肚子饿了……\r\n去道具店……不对。\r\n去咖啡厅采购食物Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb3785310d2689b20b8365b2c7818c7a42a515294fdfd1341a8d1bd9d5890f28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd3b2eb0b40dee548ecc0f89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜晚是魔物们的时间……但是！\r\n魔物们都命中注定被神鹰打倒！\r\n也就是说！神鹰的时间到了Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70ebae4717d15cd26f00a361dc80deeb4fef4f99416908276b72015a8b5904c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed21e0fb7203f3cff2e904bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在寻找旅馆吗？什么？\r\n特雷森旅馆竟然是免费的！\r\n虽然训练员进不去就是了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "775f9f0e22c8b74bad550f178ca1e2d091cf446c21303ce442bb500e0a902971",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b04104d8cf8f5c32d33a3a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天是起始的季节！\r\n神鹰式神鹰武斗术教室，\r\n一直都在招收学生Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "79ade57c0f147bde351910e2673e5fd8bda3a70f739103b627c746857534dcbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43c8875d11d845df8b7a4a07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "炎热的日子还在继续……这种时候！\r\n用拳头打碎冰块制成刨冰Death！\r\n同时也是锻炼，真是一石二鹰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56f343293df0d6635689e3e24d9d0c665113510baea24da505090113467ae8b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e730d56e27b119ebc5becab4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼！这件熊熊燃烧的深红色衣服\r\n像红叶一样美丽什么的……\r\n小草真是完全不懂Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "847a42126eca1c6229a5029399e86601fcf7eaf410be3e894ae5bb3712a06cb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98337eab81132a6e33683b97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不冷……一点都不冷Death！\r\n只要穿着这件衣服，熊熊燃烧的斗志\r\n就会产生热……阿嚏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b558bd81441cdd83fed4f8634e2a9c901b812a8608677f17e7c13e42ddffda9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bff750f7db6268d9a6a55121",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81410a4e9e8bbe88bd69ed34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85cba223f7ac79db76dcf6c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了证明神鹰是世界最强，\r\n铃鹿前辈是必须越过的关卡之一！\r\n我一定会超越她的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a91fe28c0173a649b87321571b30b64a117ce24da919860b418ec8eed724732",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b63e172ff3226f563083c2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大树前辈主办的烧烤大会……\r\n有很多肉！又大！又美味！会让我\r\n想起在美国的时候Death……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c4248581336e78e0d20541c3671d9f1a4646c53344400059bc5c6618478c598",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcff89c7d80595109ba23bec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昨天播出的摔跤比赛，\r\n训练员有看吗！？\r\n最后的空中必杀……真是bueno！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6bc4cabf771737acf5ef00759e804b1a4b53a0999741603263d3765ba0040c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab6375c0a667466d5ba0b28f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爸爸传承给我的这个面罩……\r\n因为它充满了许多炙热的意志，\r\n所以才能让我变成世・界・最・强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3da1ba2b59d1f52a4a4e79c91cda8d292223ce1361b0cc10a4faae4dd43f9726",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:509ac8fd65b0064807ba6840",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日文，英文，西班牙文……\r\n要在世界奔走是需要语言能力的！\r\n我现在正在学习法文Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1e8b6f53f9d6d74473e52116dad9a04898c52e0d91e6b562a8af5ed71ce7258",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d514348b463600b5c711bd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以动人舞姿登上舞台的\r\n是身穿华丽服装的蒙面赛馬娘！\r\n其名为，神鹰——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d24466091486a6293c70af69b363d7afc31573786219e29a949660aaa3f562c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59e630c1f55b32f49b44c274",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我能不能在演唱会的舞台上\r\n架设用来施展跳技的\r\n擂台边绳呢……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "94217bdc7b85202d08233e11a2f25a052b92e58976d9ed1ff607551bfe63f0f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edb88c71d167186e3d6c148b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是全世界都会赞赏的服装……！\r\n再来就只需要配上能取胜的跑法Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22748c6336e815332545938e47de78873213a42c11cb6616ca387704208612a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60d264c97b5bdd3e07c6b193",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有什么是神鹰办不到的！\r\n我身上这鲜红色的翅膀，\r\n将飞越整个海峡！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af9782fcdbdffe64e6a72f897f7197f713c271eb09d96bdbbd93c817981f25b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22e52351ebae2b047bdab319",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然从早就一直锻炼到现在……\r\n唔唔，但是差不多到了上课的时间Death！\r\n还想要继续锻炼的说……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9efc040ad329d487f46ba30cc937d944cb75db15f364e5bbe3a81f3381cb3d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:389536f4c1d9d902b2866dc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要不要试试看我的握力器？\r\n这个是特別订制的，\r\n非～常硬哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7d28db77bbda5f9f7ac471463ffdd20f569789e2adf5e1cbd877c61beebe479",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:516f5b81943240eaebc80090",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊……就算是神鹰，\r\n也抵挡不住睡意。今天还是睡觉，\r\n养足明天所需的精神好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d075ae3e9d041cf95b046e7b5df33593867a1acc69eadf65cd32d634c847ce2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85c0961ab9e3df6470e3a67d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "进入春风很舒服的季节了！\r\n顺着这阵风飞翔的话，感觉能\r\n施展出很厉害的飞身压制Death……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0152e7e269e9460a43a44941aa3065f0d914f832fe18b8342442c204effa5359",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c538ffa9f4be687eba1f19ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热……太热啦……！\r\n这种时候就更需要吃火辣辣的東西！\r\n只要让心更热，碰到火也会变涼快Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "500997ecf9752e966648a77bb987c7d7833766f44326a534150aee17570648c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dfee2bdbea0a9b17c94e605",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "賭上最后面一份秋季限定松茸飯，\r\n我跟小特展开了激烈的猜拳战斗……\r\n赢家，是神鹰……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f560779c04e206af3ae4d7578c036e6a0ca34259233c9addf08a35be09c82e6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:770ce1673e387b554d695902",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "神鹰明明有着太阳般炙热的心，\r\n为什么在寒冬中跑步却还是很冷Death……\r\n真是个谜团啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3aa7536b8db7c034572119ccef13e0d869bd66bf43c9a793097f6b7947a81488",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4973256ff2a54a8183112bc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着这件衣服的话，\r\n微光的眼睛就会闪闪发亮Death，\r\n明明和萝卜超人没什么关系的说……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b9b998d7b65f9314dd8a356b7a3a24c86cf76f5b785b870dbf0ef5f1ef08fd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:666f654f3d949eea3c4edb58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "探险！发现！大冒险！\r\n下次去马之谷的时候\r\n小特他们也会一起Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c60f6e507c98f5486baa692c331dc6ae6da79de3b9b055e88bb01b5b4ce7d19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b95ee1c0544bf5308603bf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "RPG也不错，\r\n但接下来要玩格斗游戏！想去见识下\r\n比神鹰更强的家伙Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "256bb49c76ae352816cc4ee39940439d3ea307615743ced62cd0c18b4236c82c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb857ed99fa7b88044073f77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在上舞蹈课的时候，圣王\r\n来参观了……神鹰的舞蹈\r\n，是最强的对吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e9d14d25affeafa624b6608b4144129135562b989625215d1092093c6255cb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9deceaa718f4f12d0fd401bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔～……以兽人和哥布林为对手的话暂且不提\r\n如果面对的是飞龙\r\n那该如何决定关节技呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b76f155d5d21ce78c0e3928a0b62b0ea8939e203937c739b2187972371978b0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd6b9d7faec2ceb643afb7e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上从向太阳打招呼开始！\r\n神鹰武斗术，\r\n早起也是最快Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd2a4d6ac28ee9d164d6195aef78d0e629894805d5ff5fa71cb8b5ee0eac6924",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6262a6d1ad0815b88ae91f0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "豪华的饭菜虽然也很好，\r\n但还是会怀念像黑面包\r\n和炖菜这样的旅馆风味Death……",
      "source_fingerprint": "92b3e6d8ac8c0c1d4f79bb9ec846a6913a5f62e34aebdc00f3a4f5983890070c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4f4d7f9a42b73f54829e0ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "睡觉之前是幻影战斗！\r\n时常想象敌人，接着与之战斗！\r\n这就是神鹰格斗家的宿命Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e365d633355493beadfb88872537d504bda41899a07adbf42fd4f3d262461e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1014",
        "91023"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
